DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11998::$$$message_0097_0000_0000$$$::I walk while pushing Bicycle No.2 and its front basket.[lr]::
11999::$$$message_0097_0000_0001$$$::The first one that was mine was being ridden by Rider before I knew it.::
12000::$$$message_0097_0001_0000$$$::"Now, I'm mostly done with shopping... Oh, yeah."[lr]::
12001::$$$message_0097_0001_0001$$$::I have to replenish things related to refreshments.[lr]::
12002::$$$message_0097_0001_0002$$$::Fuji-nee devoured the snacks we had stored, Rider ran away riding my bicycle... Those are fine, but my body feels heavy and sluggish[line len=2]it's a series of unfortunate events.::
12003::$$$message_0097_0002_0000$$$::"Fuji-nee said she'd get more snacks later, but I don't know when that'll be. Hmm... All right."[lr]::
12004::$$$message_0097_0002_0001$$$::I check the inside of my wallet.[lr]::
12005::$$$message_0097_0002_0002$$$::I was able to make it in time for the sale today, so I still have a lot of money left. I guess I'll go stop by Edomaeya for now.::
12006::$$$message_0097_0003_0000$$$::Now, is Edomaeya[line len=2]huh?::
12007::$$$message_0097_0004_0000$$$::"Ah, ayu hopping ho hinner?"[lr]::
12008::$$$message_0097_0004_0001$$$::"...Saber, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]calm down and swallow your food first."::
12009::$$$message_0097_0005_0000$$$::...How rare.[lr]::
12010::$$$message_0097_0005_0001$$$::It's rare for Saber, who draws attention, to go outside and snack on food.::
12011::$$$message_0097_0006_0000$$$::"Om nom... [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Hm? [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服01b(中) last=セイバーfd特殊03_大判a(中)]Shirou, are you shopping for dinner?"[lr]::
12012::$$$message_0097_0006_0001$$$::"Yeah. It's rare for you to come shopping at the shopping district by yourself."::
12013::$$$message_0097_0007_0000$$$::I usually give Saber my wallet when she goes grocery shopping, but I'm pretty sure I didn't give it to her today.[lr]::
12014::$$$message_0097_0007_0001$$$::Hmm, I wonder how she's paying for things...::
12015::$$$message_0097_0008_0000$$$::"Oh... Um, this is[line len=2]"[lr]::
12016::$$$message_0097_0008_0001$$$::"I have to shop at Edomaeya too. Eat it while it's warm."[lr]::
12017::$$$message_0097_0008_0002$$$::I order an equal amount of obanyaki at the counter of Edomaeya.::
12018::$$$message_0097_0009_0000$$$::"...I'm sorry for eating first by myself."[lr]::
12019::$$$message_0097_0009_0001$$$::"Well, that's yours... Wait, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服01a(中)]I hadn't given you my wallet, but were you okay?"::
12020::$$$message_0097_0010_0000$$$::"Yes, Taiga gave me some money."[lr]::
12021::$$$message_0097_0010_0001$$$::"Fuji-nee did? Wow, how generous of her to give you an allowance."[lr]::
12022::$$$message_0097_0010_0002$$$::...Her payday was quite a while ago, right?[lr]::
12023::$$$message_0097_0010_0003$$$::"Yes. Taiga was in an unusually good mood at home.[lr]::
12024::$$$message_0097_0010_0004$$$::She said to go buy snacks with this[line len=2]"::
12025::$$$message_0097_0011_0000$$$::Oh, I see...?[lr]::
12026::$$$message_0097_0011_0001$$$::"...Shirou, you are pale. Is something wrong?"[lr]::
12027::$$$message_0097_0011_0002$$$::"No... It's nothing. I see, Fuji-nee, huh..."::
12028::$$$message_0097_0012_0000$$$::So that's what this is about.[lr]::
12029::$$$message_0097_0012_0001$$$::Fuji-nee found our secret stock of emergency snacks and was having a party.[lr]::
12030::$$$message_0097_0012_0002$$$::Fuji-nee who was in a good mood from being full, [rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=藤06a(中),セイバー私服11a頬(近) time=300 flipud=0 poss=r,lc indexes=1000,2000]happily gave Saber a generous allowance.::
12031::$$$message_0097_0013_0000$$$::Saber has no way of knowing how Fuji-nee will be scolded by me and Sakura.[lr]::
12032::$$$message_0097_0013_0001$$$::She looks at me worriedly from the side, and I wave my hand to tell her that it's nothing.::
12033::$$$message_0097_0014_0000$$$::"Did something happen to Taiga?"[lr]::
12034::$$$message_0097_0014_0001$$$::"No, it's the usual Taiga.[lr]::
12035::$$$message_0097_0014_0002$$$::But... Come to think of it, I've never received any allowance from her..."::
12036::$$$message_0097_0015_0000$$$::I reminisce about the past for a bit.[lr]::
12037::$$$message_0097_0015_0001$$$::Me, a kid who was stubborn but clinging onto my old man, and Fuji-nee, who was attached to my old man.[lr]::
12038::$$$message_0097_0015_0002$$$::He played with me... Or rather, I was being played with, but I never really received any allowance.::
12039::$$$message_0097_0016_0000$$$::"...Is that true?"[lr]::
12040::$$$message_0097_0016_0001$$$::"Fuji-nee always complained when it came to money.[lr]::
12041::$$$message_0097_0016_0002$$$::Even once she got a job, I feel like she didn't change mu[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中)]... Hm?"::
12042::$$$message_0097_0017_0000$$$::Saber pauses.[lr]::
12043::$$$message_0097_0017_0001$$$::When I look back and follow her gaze...[lr]::
12044::$$$message_0097_0017_0002$$$::It's almost the season for Chinese steamed buns.[lr]::
12045::$$$message_0097_0017_0003$$$::From the steam that leaks out and the scent of meat buns, I'm also deeply moved that it's become that time of year.::
12046::$$$message_0097_0018_0000$$$::Saber touches her pocket with her hand.[lr]::
12047::$$$message_0097_0018_0001$$$::I hear the sound of coins clinking.::
12048::$$$message_0097_0019_0000$$$::"...Mrgh, it is not quite enough.[lr]::
12049::$$$message_0097_0019_0001$$$::No, I shall be satisfied with the obanyaki for today.[lr]::
12050::$$$message_0097_0019_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服13d(中) time=300]I will save the fun of the steamed buns for later... Too much happiness will dull your senses, yes."::
12051::$$$message_0097_0020_0000$$$::I hear her murmur.[lr]::
12052::$$$message_0097_0020_0001$$$::If that was the case, she should've discussed with me without having to ponder on it.::
12053::$$$message_0097_0021_0000$$$::"Are you interested in the meat buns, Saber?"[lr]::
12054::$$$message_0097_0021_0001$$$::"...No, um, I'm not.[lr]::
12055::$$$message_0097_0021_0002$$$::It would affect my appetite if I have any more snacks."[lr]::
12056::$$$message_0097_0021_0003$$$::"It's okay, I'll have half of it if you don't finish it. I still have a lot of pocket money, so you don't need to hold back."::
12057::$$$message_0097_0022_0000$$$::My wallet wouldn't cry from just one or two meat buns.[lr]::
12058::$$$message_0097_0022_0001$$$::I leave the bicycle handlebars with Saber and line up at the counter...::
12059::$$$message_0097_0023_0000$$$::"Oh, so this is a meat bun, Shirou."[lr]::
12060::$$$message_0097_0023_0001$$$::Saber picks up a meat bun full of steam.[lr]::
12061::$$$message_0097_0023_0002$$$::"...I need to thank Fuji-nee..."[lr]::
12062::$$$message_0097_0023_0003$$$::If it wasn't for Fuji-nee acting on a whim, I wouldn't have been able to see Saber like this.::
12063::$$$message_0097_0024_0000$$$::"The good flavor of the meat soup is trapped inside of the dough... Hm."[lr]::
12064::$$$message_0097_0024_0001$$$::Saber nods, her mouth full with a meat bun.[lr]::
12065::$$$message_0097_0024_0002$$$::I can't make something like this at home.[lr]::
12066::$$$message_0097_0024_0003$$$::I would need a steamer or a steaming basket, and it seems like you would need a trick to knead that dough too.::
12067::$$$message_0097_0025_0000$$$::"Now, let's go back, Saber."[lr]::
12068::$$$message_0097_0025_0001$$$::"...Um, this is hard for me to say, but..."[lr]::
12069::$$$message_0097_0025_0002$$$::Saber pauses and is restless.[lr]::
12070::$$$message_0097_0025_0003$$$::Her gaze is still on the steamed bun steamer.::
12071::$$$message_0097_0026_0000$$$::"I am interested in that steamed sweet bean bun. What is it like?"[lr]::
12072::$$$message_0097_0026_0001$$$::"...Okay. I'll keep you company until the end."::
12073::$$$message_0097_0027_0000$$$::My wallet won't budge over two or three steamed buns.[lr]::
12074::$$$message_0097_0027_0001$$$::...At least, that's what I'd like to believe, but I would have to think of some plan in case her interest shifts towards authentic steamed buns, pizza buns, curry buns, or specially made shark fin buns. ::
12075::$$$message_0097_0028_0000$$$::"Good timing, Shirou and Saber."[lr]::
12076::$$$message_0097_0028_0001$$$::"Rider!?"[lr]::
12077::$$$message_0097_0028_0002$$$::Turning Bicycle No.1 of the Emiya household, Rider suddenly appears.[lr]::
12078::$$$message_0097_0028_0003$$$::She locks her brakes and drifts, making a sudden stop.[lr]::
12079::$$$message_0097_0028_0004$$$::Mrgh... It's true that it got stolen from me, but she makes my complaints disappear riding it that perfectly.::
12080::$$$message_0097_0029_0000$$$::"Nom... [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊02_肉まんa頬汗(近),セイバー私服01a(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=552 top=57 time=300 accel=2 storage=セイバーfd特殊02_肉まんa頬汗(近)][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 opacity=0 time=100 storage=セイバー私服01a(中) last=セイバーfd特殊02_肉まんa頬汗(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=300 pos=r accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服01a(中)]Mm, what is it, Rider?"[lr]::
12081::$$$message_0097_0029_0001$$$::Oh, on Saber's mouth...[lr]::
12082::$$$message_0097_0029_0002$$$::She looks at Rider with a fixed gaze, but there's no dignity.::
12083::$$$message_0097_0030_0000$$$::"...You were eating a meat bun, right? You have some crumbs on you."[lr]::
12084::$$$message_0097_0030_0001$$$::"Khh...[lr]::
12085::$$$message_0097_0030_0002$$$::No, more importantly, why are you stopping us?"::
12086::$$$message_0097_0031_0000$$$::It might be because Rider caught her in an embarrassing moment, but Saber is confrontational.[lr]::
12087::$$$message_0097_0031_0001$$$::...This is bad.[lr]::
12088::$$$message_0097_0031_0002$$$::Rider would talk back like this...::
12089::$$$message_0097_0032_0000$$$::"I am utterly disgusted at you disrupting the peace of the shopping district with you driving like that and doing as you wish.[lr]::
12090::$$$message_0097_0032_0001$$$::After all, Riders are noisy beings that are like raging, unruly horses."::
12091::$$$message_0097_0033_0000$$$::"Oh, it is regrettable to hear you say so. I see, but could you say the same after seeing this?"[lr]::
12092::$$$message_0097_0033_0001$$$::Then, what Rider takes out of her bag is[line len=2]::
12093::$$$message_0097_0034_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"[lr]::
12094::$$$message_0097_0034_0001$$$::"...Heh."[lr]::
12095::$$$message_0097_0034_0002$$$::An obanyaki from Verde's underground food area.::
12096::$$$message_0097_0035_0000$$$::"R-R-R-Rider, w-w-what is[line len=2]"[lr]::
12097::$$$message_0097_0035_0001$$$::"Can you not tell?[lr]::
12098::$$$message_0097_0035_0002$$$::It is your favorite obanyakis. Not only do I have whole red bean paste and smooth bean paste, but I also have custard, cheese, and chocolate that are not in Edomaeya's selection."::
12099::$$$message_0097_0036_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12100::$$$message_0097_0036_0001$$$::"...Khh."[lr]::
12101::$$$message_0097_0036_0002$$$::Saber looks distressed.[lr]::
12102::$$$message_0097_0036_0003$$$::Either surrendering to Rider and getting obanyakis or sticking through with her original intention and just putting up with her red bean bun.::
12103::$$$message_0097_0037_0000$$$::"...I will gladly accept if I am able to...[lr]::
12104::$$$message_0097_0037_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバー私服20a(中)]What are your conditions, Rider?"[lr]::
12105::$$$message_0097_0037_0002$$$::Saber easily gives in.[lr]::
12106::$$$message_0097_0037_0003$$$::...It is a swift decision that lives up to the King of Knights' name.::
12107::$$$message_0097_0038_0000$$$::The obanyaki is handed to her.[lr]::
12108::$$$message_0097_0038_0001$$$::So. What will be forced upon Saber in compensation for Rider's obanyaki?::
12109::$$$message_0097_0039_0000$$$::"No, nothing."[lr]::
12110::$$$message_0097_0039_0001$$$::"Wha!?"::
12111::$$$message_0097_0040_0000$$$::"Wha hoo you heen hy ha!?"[lr]::
12112::$$$message_0097_0040_0001$$$::"...Saber? The obanyaki won't run away even if you don't hurry and stuff your face."::
12113::$$$message_0097_0041_0000$$$::...She's already eating.[lr]::
12114::$$$message_0097_0041_0001$$$::Could it be that she liked chocolate or custard that much...?::
12115::$$$message_0097_0042_0000$$$::"Saber. I've always disliked that feeling of discontent where those who live under the same roof pick a fight with each other every time they see each other.[lr]::
12116::$$$message_0097_0042_0001$$$::That is why I wanted to use this opportunity to get close with you, so I thought I would use this as a way of greeting."::
12117::$$$message_0097_0043_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12118::$$$message_0097_0043_0001$$$::I nod at Rider's opinion.[lr]::
12119::$$$message_0097_0043_0002$$$::That was a very mature big sister-like statement.::
12120::$$$message_0097_0044_0000$$$::"...Khh."[lr]::
12121::$$$message_0097_0044_0001$$$::On the other hand, Saber is ashamed of her actions.[lr]::
12122::$$$message_0097_0044_0002$$$::Saber is reflecting on the fact that she not only lost to the taste of obanyaki, but was also shown how big-hearted Rider is.::
12123::$$$message_0097_0045_0000$$$::"...Shirou, would you laugh at me?"[lr]::
12124::$$$message_0097_0045_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
12125::$$$message_0097_0045_0002$$$::"I did not give things enough consideration.[lr]::
12126::$$$message_0097_0045_0003$$$::You were only wishing for peaceful days, yet I have been... This negligence of mine in the old days was[line len=2]"::
12127::$$$message_0097_0046_0000$$$::"They will cool down if you don't hurry and eat them, Saber."[lr]::
12128::$$$message_0097_0046_0001$$$::"Oh yes, [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊02_大判a頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバーfd特殊02_大判a頬(中) last=セイバー私服05d(中)]om nom..."[lr]::
12129::$$$message_0097_0046_0002$$$::...Rider has completely baited Saber.[lr]::
12130::$$$message_0097_0046_0003$$$::Hmm... I'm seeing quite a rare spectacle today.[lr]::
12131::$$$message_0097_0046_0004$$$::Rider smiles in this direction.::
12132::$$$message_0097_0047_0000$$$::"That is right, I had something that I wanted you to accept, Shirou."[lr]::
12133::$$$message_0097_0047_0001$$$::"...Well, it's not like I'm hungry yet."[lr]::
12134::$$$message_0097_0047_0002$$$::Rider is rather thoughtful and generous today.[lr]::
12135::$$$message_0097_0047_0003$$$::Could it be that...::
12136::$$$message_0097_0048_0000$$$::"Did you get an allowance from Fuji-nee too, Rider?"[lr]::
12137::$$$message_0097_0048_0001$$$::"No, this is my own money.[lr]::
12138::$$$message_0097_0048_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=ライダー私服02d(中) time=300]Please accept it as my daily gratitude and apology for causing you trouble."::
12139::$$$message_0097_0049_0000$$$::"...Here, Shirou."[lr]::
12140::$$$message_0097_0049_0001$$$::"Oh... Thanks."[lr]::
12141::$$$message_0097_0049_0002$$$::"I think this is necessary for you right now."::
12142::$$$message_0097_0050_0000$$$::I flip over the vial that she hands me and look at the label...[lr]::
12143::$$$message_0097_0050_0001$$$::"Strengthening Garlic Yohimbe Maca DX"[lr]::
12144::$$$message_0097_0050_0002$$$::...What kind of word association game is this?::
12145::$$$message_0097_0051_0000$$$::"You seem to be tired, so I thought you could have this and raise your viril[line len=2][cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02d(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ライダー私服02d(中)]I mean, vitality."[lr]::
12146::$$$message_0097_0051_0001$$$::"...Oh, hmm."[lr]::
12147::$$$message_0097_0051_0002$$$::My face twitches from the poisonous-looking label.[lr]::
12148::$$$message_0097_0051_0003$$$::Isn't this more like an aphrodisiac than an energy drink...? Did she avoid a viper or sea snake because she's Rider?::
12149::$$$message_0097_0052_0000$$$::"It may stink at first or be hard to swallow, but..."[lr]::
12150::$$$message_0097_0052_0001$$$::"Uh, Rider?"[lr]::
12151::$$$message_0097_0052_0002$$$::"Would beer yeast have been better?"[lr]::
12152::$$$message_0097_0052_0003$$$::"That's not it..."[lr]::
12153::$$$message_0097_0052_0004$$$::I beckon Rider over with my fingers.::
12154::$$$message_0097_0053_0000$$$::"...Hey. What the heck happened with you today?"[lr]::
12155::$$$message_0097_0053_0001$$$::"...Well, there were a lot of things on my mind."[lr]::
12156::$$$message_0097_0053_0002$$$::"...I see... I thought that Fuji-nee or Sakura told you two to get along."[lr]::
12157::$$$message_0097_0053_0003$$$::"...Not exactly."::
12158::$$$message_0097_0054_0000$$$::"...I'm even more confused.[lr]::
12159::$$$message_0097_0054_0001$$$::One for me and Saber... Oh, can you buy something for Sakura too?"[lr]::
12160::$$$message_0097_0054_0002$$$::"Yes, Sakura is the most essential after all..."[lr]::
12161::$$$message_0097_0054_0003$$$::"Essential? Not important or precious?[lr]::
12162::$$$message_0097_0054_0004$$$::Ahh... Are you hiding something from Sakura?"::
12163::$$$message_0097_0055_0000$$$::"...What are you talking about?"[lr]::
12164::$$$message_0097_0055_0001$$$::How suspicious. She's outright suspicious.::
12165::$$$message_0097_0056_0000$$$::"No, Shirou, I..."::
12166::$$$message_0097_0057_0000$$$::"..."::
12167::$$$message_0097_0058_0000$$$::"Are you snatching food!? Senpai!"[lr]::
12168::$$$message_0097_0058_0001$$$::"Hrrk!!!"::
12169::$$$message_0097_0059_0000$$$::"..."::
12170::$$$message_0097_0060_0000$$$::"Y-You two, don't get so mad!"[lr]::
12171::$$$message_0097_0060_0001$$$::"Fuji-nee, is that something you can say after devouring all that?[lr]::
12172::$$$message_0097_0060_0002$$$::You should reflect on your actions."[lr]::
12173::$$$message_0097_0060_0003$$$::"Yes, you should've said so if you wanted snacks.[lr]::
12174::$$$message_0097_0060_0004$$$::You should reflect on your actions."::
12175::$$$message_0097_0061_0000$$$::"Well, I don't want to be that impersonal with Shirou's snacks, [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(-30,6,187)(-30,24,187)(-30,9,187)(-30,30,187)(-30,20,187) storage=藤02g腕a(近) accel=0]what I want is a dining table all to myself! Shirou's things are my things, booo!"::
12176::$$$message_0097_0062_0000$$$::"..."::
12177::$$$message_0097_0063_0000$$$::"Still, how many times do I have to tell you [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]that stealing is bad!?"::
12178::$$$message_0097_0064_0000$$$::"Eek!"::
12179::$$$message_0097_0065_0000$$$::"Man! Sakura is so scary."[lr]::
12180::$$$message_0097_0065_0001$$$::"...Well, it is the special limited edition cake that Sakura reserved from Fleur that she had been looking forward to since a month prior... If someone had stolen it, even I would[line len=2]"[lr]::
12181::$$$message_0097_0065_0002$$$::"Sen[wvl][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-4]pai! You are too soft on Ms. Fujimura! As someone who is in charge of housework, please do not mix business with private matters!"[lr]::
12182::$$$message_0097_0065_0003$$$::"Yes, you must be more serious, Fuji-nee.[lr]::
12183::$$$message_0097_0065_0004$$$::You should reflect on your actions. Sakura is seriously scary."::
12184::$$$message_0097_0066_0000$$$::"..."::
12185::$$$message_0097_0067_0000$$$::"How many times do I have to tell you that stealing food is bad!?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][rf]::
12186::$$$message_0097_0068_0000$$$::"..."::
12187::$$$message_0097_0069_0000$$$::"Heheheheh... Rider?[lr]::
12188::$$$message_0097_0069_0001$$$::You were secretly drinking Senpai's blood, weren't you?"[lr]::
12189::$$$message_0097_0069_0002$$$::"..."::
12190::$$$message_0097_0070_0000$$$::"Oh, did you think that I wouldn't notice if you stayed quiet?[lr]::
12191::$$$message_0097_0070_0001$$$::Even if I can overlook Ms. Fujimura stealing some food, when it comes to you secretly drinking Senpai's blood... [cacheimage storage=黒衣桜05b(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=黒衣桜05b(遠)]Heheheh."[lr]::
12192::$$$message_0097_0070_0002$$$::"..."::
12193::$$$message_0097_0071_0000$$$::"I need to punish you...don't I, Rider?"[lr]::
12194::$$$message_0097_0071_0001$$$::"..."::
12195::$$$message_0097_0072_0000$$$::"..."[wm canskip=0]::
12196::$$$message_0097_0073_0000$$$::"I said I'm reflecting, Sakura and Shirou!"[lr]::
12197::$$$message_0097_0073_0001$$$::"C'mon, she said she's reflecting, Sakura."[lr]::
12198::$$$message_0097_0073_0002$$$::"Yep. I ate it in the heat of the moment, but I didn't mean to eat it all. I'm reflecting on it."[lr]::
12199::$$$message_0097_0073_0003$$$::"Your clumsy comment that sounds like it's coming from a juvenile crime suspect is very much like you, but... Umm?"::
12200::$$$message_0097_0074_0000$$$::"Understood! [wm canskip=0]I, Fujimura, am sorry for causing all you respectable people trouble. I shall properly apologize![lr]::
12201::$$$message_0097_0074_0001$$$::I won't be able to face my grandfather if you all think I'm a fellow that doesn't have the debt of gratitude for a night's lodging and a meal."::
12202::$$$message_0097_0075_0000$$$::"Hrrk!"::
12203::$$$message_0097_0076_0000$$$::"An apology huh... Stop getting more persimmons, our shelf is about to reach its limit."[lr]::
12204::$$$message_0097_0076_0001$$$::"But, we must accept the will of Ms. Fujimura's apology, right, Senpai?"[lr]::
12205::$$$message_0097_0076_0002$$$::"...Well, that's true."::
12206::$$$message_0097_0077_0000$$$::"There are many big-hearted people here, so if you apologize, no one would mind, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
12207::$$$message_0097_0077_0001$$$::"Ah, you're such a good kid, Sakura. Switch places with that bratty little girl!"[lr]::
12208::$$$message_0097_0077_0002$$$::"Don't!"[wm canskip=0]::
12209::$$$message_0097_0078_0000$$$::"...I see.[wvs][sestop time=400 nowait=true][lr]::
12210::$$$message_0097_0078_0001$$$::An apology.[lr]::
12211::$$$message_0097_0078_0002$$$::If you apologize, everyone would forgive you..."::
12212::$$$message_0097_0079_0000$$$::"...Who knows?[lr]::
12213::$$$message_0097_0079_0001$$$::I do not know anything."[lr]::
12214::$$$message_0097_0079_0002$$$::"...If you say so, then that's fine."[lr]::
12215::$$$message_0097_0079_0003$$$::It seems like Rider was looking into the distance, lost in thought... I wonder what happened.::
12216::$$$message_0097_0080_0000$$$::"I'll gladly drink this for now."[lr]::
12217::$$$message_0097_0080_0001$$$::"Yes, please do when you're anemic or decreased in libido.[lr]::
12218::$$$message_0097_0080_0002$$$::I have something to give to Sakura, so I will excuse myself."[lr]::
12219::$$$message_0097_0080_0003$$$::Rider, who straddles No.1 in front of us...::
12220::$$$message_0097_0081_0000$$$::"...He hus hent hoff."[lr]::
12221::$$$message_0097_0081_0001$$$::"Don't have things in your mouth when you talk... Yeah, she just went off riding No.1."::
12222::$$$message_0097_0082_0000$$$::"Om... Nom. [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊03_大判b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバーfd特殊03_大判b(近)]No, I wonder what happened.[lr]::
12223::$$$message_0097_0082_0001$$$::I wonder... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服13b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服13b(近)]Oh, but I cannot describe the sweetness of this custard obanyaki that spreads smoothly and slowly in my mouth..."::
12224::$$$message_0097_0083_0000$$$::Saber indulges in the flavor of the obanyaki.[lr]::
12225::$$$message_0097_0083_0001$$$::...Whatever.[lr]::
12226::$$$message_0097_0083_0002$$$::There's no use in tactlessly prying into things.::
12227::$$$message_0097_0084_0000$$$::"Then, let's go home since we finished shopping."[lr]::
12228::$$$message_0097_0084_0001$$$::"...Please wait, Shirou."[lr]::
12229::$$$message_0097_0084_0002$$$::She calls me to a halt as I lift up my heel.::
12230::$$$message_0097_0085_0000$$$::"...What's wrong, Saber?"[lr]::
12231::$$$message_0097_0085_0001$$$::"I still haven't had the red bean bun ye[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中)]hrrk!?"[lr]::
12232::$$$message_0097_0085_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Rider!? Didn't she leave?[font italic=false]::
12233::$$$message_0097_0086_0000$$$::"You say quite aloof things, Saber. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服01c(中)]You should've told me if you wanted to eat the red bean bun..."[lr]::
12234::$$$message_0097_0086_0001$$$::Rider says while smiling.[lr]::
12235::$$$message_0097_0086_0002$$$::Saber isn't being cautious this time.[lr]::
12236::$$$message_0097_0086_0003$$$::No, she's so happy that if she had a tail and ears, they would be wagging.::
12237::$$$message_0097_0087_0000$$$::"R-Really?"[lr]::
12238::$$$message_0097_0087_0001$$$::"Yes, we are friends, correct, Saber?"[lr]::
12239::$$$message_0097_0087_0002$$$::"Yes... I am embarrassed of myself for thinking that you were a selfish woman that had different attributes to me... I shall gladly accept it."[lr]::
12240::$$$message_0097_0087_0003$$$::[font italic=true]...She baited her, right?[font italic=false]::
12241::$$$message_0097_0088_0000$$$::"Then, please have it while it is hot."[lr]::
12242::$$$message_0097_0088_0001$$$::"Of course, of course... [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊03_肉まんa頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバーfd特殊03_肉まんa頬(中)]hof hof hof."::
12243::$$$message_0097_0089_0000$$$::Like a scene between close sisters.[lr]::
12244::$$$message_0097_0089_0001$$$::The two that are usually arguing are acting differently just for today.[lr]::
12245::$$$message_0097_0089_0002$$$::...If they were always like that, then things would be a lot easier.::
12246::$$$message_0097_0090_0000$$$::"Would you like a red bean bun, Shirou?"[lr]::
12247::$$$message_0097_0090_0001$$$::"...Please feed Saber more than me until she's even more satisfied. Oh, it goes without saying, but don't leave any food on your plate at dinner."::
12248::$$$message_0097_0091_0000$$$::"Of course. I have another stomach for meals, Shirou."[lr]::
12249::$$$message_0097_0091_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12250::$$$message_0097_0091_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
12251::$$$message_0097_0091_0003$$$::I can't help but make eye contact.[lr]::
12252::$$$message_0097_0091_0004$$$::Umm, it's usually the opposite, right...?::�